      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON RAYNER (1) was a winner (24.11) at Bendigo two back but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won two of three tries. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. DADDY COOL (3) goes very well here starting 24 times for 11 wins and five minors. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (19.74) in a Grade 4/5 last time at Traralgon. Looks one of the chances. HERE COMES BILLY (5) shapes well for this after winning last start over the 435m at this track in an enormous 24.21. Harder here but expected to feature again. PAW OLYMPUS (2) scored by 2.5 lengths last time (24.11) in a Grade 4/5 over 435m at this track. Boasts a top strike-rate from this draw, winning three of five runs.",
